      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please—catch that alpha Weedle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C00650061007300652014006300610074006300680020007400680061007400200061006C00700068006100200057006500650064006C00650021001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see you successfully caught that giant pest.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000730065006500200079006F00750020007300750063006300650073007300660075006C006C00790020006300610075006700680074002000740068006100740020006700690061006E007400200070006500730074002E001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My dear plants should be safe now...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00790020006400650061007200200070006C0061006E00740073002000730068006F0075006C0064002000620065002000730061006600650020006E006F0077002E002E002E001000020114013C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m relieved, and yet...I feel a little empty inside.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCould it be that those Weedle wormed their way\ninto my heart?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Say, young Trainer...I don’t suppose you’d let me\nhave that alpha Weedle?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure, it’s yours!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007500720065002C0020006900742019007300200079006F00750072007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nope, it’s mine",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00700065002C002000690074201900730020006D0069006E00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahhh... I never appreciated it before, but this\nWeedle has such a magnificent poison stinger!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We may have fought over it eating my plants, but\nthat’s just proof of my green thumb!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "From now on, I’ll have this Weedle guard my\nplants, and I’ll feed it choice leaves in return.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nThank you for all your help, young Trainer!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm... I suppose a Trainer is better equipped to\nhandle that Weedle than a gardener like me...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nWell, do take good care of it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕļ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
